00:16:03.728 --> 00:16:06.331
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:16:06.331 --> 00:16:07.999
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:16:07.999 --> 00:16:09.501
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:16:09.501 --> 00:16:11.837
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:16:11.837 --> 00:16:13.538
Stay safe.
Wear a mask.

00:16:13.538 --> 00:16:15.374
Get vaccinated.
We love you.

